oken th-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">defineConfig</span>({\n  ...installConfig,\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">ui</span>: { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">workspace</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;../../packages/ui&quot;</span> },\n})","file":"apps/web/kirana.config.ts","title":"apps/web/kirana.config.ts"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every later command run in the app reads "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">workspace</span>","source":"ui.workspace"}},{"type":"text","value":" and works on the package:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style ui add button","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui add button","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the button lands in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"packages/ui/src/components","source":"packages/ui/src/components"}},{"type":"text","value":", and its packages are\ninstalled in the package;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the package's lockfile records it, and the package's configuration checks it;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"a font, and the attributes "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"preset","source":"preset"}},{"type":"text","value":" sets, still go into the app, which loads\nthe stylesheets and renders "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"&lt;<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">html</span>&gt;","source":"<html>"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The app's "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui","source":"ui"}},{"type":"text","value":" holds "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"workspace","source":"workspace"}},{"type":"text","value":" alone. The other settings are the package's, a\nregistry given as a path among them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The app's build compiles the package's files with the app's configuration,\nwhich is why both spread the design system's. Run from the workspace's root,\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> check apps/web/src packages/ui/src","source":"kirana-style check apps/web/src packages/ui/src"}},{"type":"text","value":" reads each folder's own, as\nthe lint plugin does when "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"settings.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">kirana</span>.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">root</span>","source":"settings.kirana.root"}},{"type":"text","value":" is left unset."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-lockfile","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The lockfile"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"kirana-style.lock.json","source":"kirana-style.lock.json"}},{"type":"text","value":" records each installed component: the registry it came\nfrom, its version, the framework and base, and for each file two hashes. One is\nof the registry's content, the other of what was written. Commit it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The two hashes are how the later commands tell the registry's change from yours:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style ui outdated\nnpx kirana-style ui diff button","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui outdated\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui diff button","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"changing-the-design","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Changing the design"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A design system says which axes it has (a style, a base colour, a radius …) and\nhow a preset code holds them. Give a code to "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"init","source":"init"}},{"type":"text","value":", or change it later:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style ui preset k2bS6","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui preset k2bS6","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"preset","source":"preset"}},{"type":"text","value":" writes the design to "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">design</span>","source":"ui.design"}},{"type":"text","value":" and sets its attributes on "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"&lt;<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">html</span>&gt;","source":"<html>"}},{"type":"text","value":",\nwhere your design system's styles are. Then it places every installed component\nagain: a registry that flattened its style modules for the new design gives you\nthat build, with only the new style's values in it. So do its colours, fonts and\nradius, where the registry built them for each value. A file you changed stops it\nuntil you look, or pass "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-variable\">--overwrite</span>","source":"--overwrite"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To keep every design installed instead, for a theme switcher of your own, start\nwith "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-variable\">--all-designs</span>","source":"--all-designs"}},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style ui init --preset k2bS6 --all-designs","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui init <span class=\"th-token th-attr\">--preset</span> k2bS6 <span class=\"th-token th-attr\">--all-designs</span>","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It sets "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">allDesigns</span>","source":"ui.allDesigns"}},{"type":"text","value":", and every later "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"add","source":"add"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"update","source":"update"}},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"preset","source":"preset"}},{"type":"text","value":" installs the\nfiles as written, with every design in them. Icons stay your one library."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When a code picks a font the project does not have, it is installed, as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"init","source":"init"}},{"type":"text","value":"\ninstalls the fonts its code names. A font no axis uses any more stays, and the\ncommand says so."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"updating-and-removing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Updating and removing"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style ui update","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui update","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"update","source":"update"}},{"type":"text","value":" writes what the registry changed and keeps what you changed. Where both\nof you changed the same file, it stops before writing anything: "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui diff","source":"ui diff"}},{"type":"text","value":" shows\nthe two sides, and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-variable\">--overwrite</span>","source":"--overwrite"}},{"type":"text","value":" takes the registry's. A registry that changes a\ncomponent's files without a new version is refused."}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style ui remove dialog","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style ui remove dialog","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"remove","source":"remove"}},{"type":"text","value":" deletes the files you left as they were installed and keeps the ones you\nchanged. It refuses a component another installed one still needs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"your-registries","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your registries"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana UI's registry is known as "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana","source":"@kirana"}},{"type":"text","value":". Name others in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"kirana.config.ts","source":"kirana.config.ts"}},{"type":"text","value":",\nunder "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/reference/config#ui","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"ui.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">registries</span>","source":"ui.registries"}}]},{"type":"text","value":", and in